    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d347">

                <pb facs="0394" n="382" xml:id="pg382"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">President Roosevelt to
                        the British Prime Minister</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Churchill</hi>)<anchor n="21" xml:id="d347-f1"/>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">[<placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1943-10-01">1 October, 1943</date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>367. Your 427 and 427.<anchor n="22" xml:id="d347-f2"/> Italy has not yet made a
                    declaration of war against Germany.</p>
                <p>I suggest that you endeavor to obtain from Stalin approval of your text of
                    proposed joint statement by all three of us to be made public immediately
                    following a declaration of war against Germany by Italy.</p>
                <p>Your text meets with my approval.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Roosevelt</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
